        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Narration with a Music Bed\n\nVoices a script and mixes it over a generated music bed. Use it for a quick narrated spot with background music.\n\n**How it works:** \"Narrate\" reads the \"Script\". \"Normalize\" and a \"Gain\" of -3 dB set the voice level, and \"GetAudioInfo\" measures its length. \"Bed\" generates music, which \"Trim\" cuts to the voice length. A \"Gain\" of -18 dB, \"FadeIn\" and \"FadeOut\" sit it under the voice. \"Mix\" overlays both, and \"Narration\" plays the result.\n\n**Try this:** Pick models on \"Narrate\" and \"Bed\", then change the music prompt on \"Bed\", for example to \"warm acoustic guitar, slow tempo\"."
        },
